creatures:
- name: Giant Eagle
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 13  
      **Hit Points** 26 (rollable(dice=4d10 + 4,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 10 ft., Fly 80 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** necrotic, radiant  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Celestial; understands Common and Primordial (Auran) but can't speak them  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The eagle makes two Rend attacks.

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Radiant damage.

    type: custom
